**********************  bbsQUICK REVISION HISTORY  **********************

Version 8.3   6 December 1994
 Additions:
   Interlace setting in prefs
   Edit Requests - Edit or Kill ready-to-upload messages and files.
 Fixes:
   Backslashes in message body could make RexxArpLib requester fail.
   Small updates to bbsQUICK.DOC


Version 8.2   21 October 1994
 Fixes:
   Forgot to remove some "SAY" statements used for debugging.


Version 8.0   2 September 1994
 Improvements:
   Choose Files, Messages, or both when using the APPEND function.
 Fixes:
   APPEND function was broken.


Version 7.5   20 August 1994
 Improvements:
   Create/Edit signature file from Prefs window.
   Lines beginning with ">" are ignored when seeking messages by number.
 Fixes:
   Needed a window reset after loading a new .prefs file.


Version 6.5   3 August 1994
 Improvements:
   Modifications made to provide a facility to add a 'Signature' to any
   outgoing E-Mail or Messages. Thanks Sion Griffiths, North Wales, UK!


Version 6.4  18 October 1993
 Fixes:
   Uploaded file description displayed too low (or not at all)


Version 6.3  4 September 1993
 Fixes:
   Some small graphics and display changes.


Version 6.2  2 August 1993
 Fixes:
   Minor internal changes.


Version 6.1  19 July 1993
 Fixes:
   Send original mail broken for archives received from BBBBS 5.9 & below.


Version 6.0  14 July 1993
  Reads your "Friends" list so you can use aliases to address email.
  Requester shows "marked" (unread and addressed to you) messages.
  Added "SaveAs" for EMail and notices.


Version 5.9   9 June 1993
  Now works with "c:version" command from all OS, 1.2 - 3.0
  Menu "Previous" command was broken (worked ok from gadget).
  Super-sysop can return "expired" messages to conferences.
  Limited upload filename length to fit into the Files.ALPHA list.
  Deleting an individual notice was broken.


Version 5.8a  11 April 1993  -  From Hong Kong
  Long library name made download requester fail.
  Messages to "SYSOP" are now readdressed if necessary.


Version 5.8  24 March 1993  -  From Hong Kong
  First public release
